  "menu_guide": "Rehber",
  "guide_title": "\uD83D\uDCD6 Kullan\u0131m K\u0131lavuzu \u0026 Yol Haritas\u0131",
  "guide_subtitle": "Program\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131, \u00E7al\u0131\u015Fma mant\u0131\u011F\u0131 ve geli\u015Ftirici yol haritas\u0131",
  "guide_tab_user": "\uD83D\uDC65 Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Rehberi",
  "guide_tab_dev": "\uD83D\uDCBB Geli\u015Ftirici \u0026 Mimari",
  "guide_app_version": "UYGULAMA S\u00DCR\u00DCM\u00DC",
  "guide_db_path": "AKT\u0130F VER\u0130TABANI YOLU",
  "guide_settings_path": "AYARLAR DOSYASI YOLU",
  "guide_user_quickstart_title": "H\u0131zl\u0131 Ba\u015Flang\u0131\u00E7 \u0026 Temel \u0130\u015F Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131",
  "guide_user_quickstart_desc": "Stokendra\u0027y\u0131 kullanmaya ba\u015Flamak i\u00E7in \u015Fu temel ad\u0131mlar\u0131 izleyin:\n1. Stok Kartlar\u0131: Envanterinizdeki \u00FCr\u00FCnleri tan\u0131mlay\u0131n (\u00D6rn: A4 Ka\u011F\u0131t, Ethernet Kablosu).\n2. Stok Hareketleri: \u00DCr\u00FCnlerin mevcut stok miktarlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00FCncellemek i\u00E7in \u0027Yeni Hareket Ekle\u0027 butonu ile [Giri\u015F] veya [\u00C7\u0131k\u0131\u015F] i\u015Flemi olu\u015Fturun.\n3. Servis Kay\u0131tlar\u0131: Ar\u0131zal\u0131 veya teknik servise sevk edilen cihazlar\u0131n s\u00FCre\u00E7lerini ve durumlar\u0131n\u0131 anl\u0131k takip edin.\n4. Raporlar \u0026 Grafikler: Dashboard \u00FCzerinden en \u00E7ok kullan\u0131lan \u00FCr\u00FCnleri ve kritik stok seviyesine d\u00FC\u015Fen kartlar\u0131 analiz edin.\n5. G\u00FCvenlik \u0026 Ayarlar: Sistem her g\u00FCn otomatik yedek al\u0131r. Ayr\u0131ca istedi\u011Finiz an veritaban\u0131 veya ZIP/SQL yede\u011Fi alabilirsiniz.",
  "guide_user_stockcards_title": "Stok Kart\u0131 Olu\u015Fturma \u0026 Y\u00F6netimi (Hiyerar\u015Fik Yap\u0131)",
  "guide_user_stockcards_desc": "Envanter yap\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 a\u011Fa\u00E7 yap\u0131s\u0131 \u015Feklinde (\u00DCst/Alt kart ili\u015Fkisi) hiyerar\u015Fik olarak kurgulayabilirsiniz:\n\u2022 \u00DCst Kart (Parent): Sadece gruplama ve kategori g\u00F6revi \u00FCstlenir. \u00DCzerinde stok miktar\u0131 tutulmaz ve do\u011Frudan stok hareketi eklenemez. \u00D6rne\u011Fin; \u0027Bilgisayar Bile\u015Fenleri\u0027 veya \u0027A\u011F Cihazlar\u0131\u0027 birer \u00DCst Kartt\u0131r.\n\u2022 Alt Kart (Child): \u00DCzerinde stok miktar\u0131 bar\u0131nd\u0131rabilen ve giri\u015F/\u00E7\u0131k\u0131\u015F hareketi girilebilen ger\u00E7ek envanter \u00FCr\u00FCnleridir. Bir Alt Kart\u0131 \u00FCst men\u00FCden se\u00E7erek ilgili bir \u00DCst Karta ba\u011Flayabilirsiniz.\n\u2022 Asgari Stok (Minimum Stock): \u00DCr\u00FCn\u00FCn kritik stok limitidir. Stok seviyesi bu de\u011Ferin alt\u0131na indi\u011Finde dashboard ekran\u0131nda k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 uyar\u0131 listesine yans\u0131r ve raporlarda listelenir.\n\u2022 Birimler: \u00DCr\u00FCnlerinizi adet, metre, kutu veya paket gibi farkl\u0131 birimlerle tan\u0131mlayabilirsiniz.",
  "guide_user_movements_title": "Stok Giri\u015F \u0026 \u00C7\u0131k\u0131\u015F \u0130\u015Flemleri ve Toplu Excel Y\u00FCkleme",
  "guide_user_movements_desc": "Stok seviyelerini dinamik g\u00FCncellemenin yegane yolu stok hareketleridir:\n\u2022 Stok Giri\u015Fi (Entry): Sat\u0131n al\u0131nan, devir al\u0131nan veya say\u0131m fazlas\u0131 olan \u00FCr\u00FCnleri envantere eklemek i\u00E7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.\n\u2022 Stok \u00C7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131 (Exit): Departmanlara veya personele zimmetlenen, kullan\u0131m veya sat\u0131\u015F amac\u0131yla envanterden d\u00FC\u015F\u00FClen \u00FCr\u00FCnleri kaydeder. \u0130\u015Flem esnas\u0131nda teslim edilen departman ve personel bilgisi girilebilir.\n\u2022 \u00C7oklu H\u0131zl\u0131 Hareket (Toplu Ekleme): \u0027Toplu Giri\u015F/\u00C7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0027 butonuyla birden fazla \u00FCr\u00FCne ayn\u0131 anda tek ekrandan miktar girerek toplu hareket kayd\u0131 a\u00E7abilirsiniz.\n\u2022 Excel \u0130\u00E7e/D\u0131\u015Fa Aktarma: Excel \u015Fablonu ile binlerce hareketi tek t\u0131kla i\u00E7eri aktarabilir veya filtrelenmi\u015F t\u00FCm kay\u0131tlar\u0131 d\u0131\u015Fa aktarabilirsiniz.",
  "guide_user_services_title": "Teknik Servis Kay\u0131tlar\u0131 ve Cihaz Durum Takibi",
  "guide_user_services_desc": "Ar\u0131zal\u0131 veya onar\u0131ma giden cihazlar\u0131n takibini kolayla\u015Ft\u0131ran mod\u00FCld\u00FCr:\n\u2022 Servis Kayd\u0131 Olu\u015Fturma: Cihaz\u0131n ad\u0131n\u0131, seri numaras\u0131n\u0131, ilgili firmay\u0131, ar\u0131za detaylar\u0131n\u0131 ve bak\u0131m tarihini kaydedin.\n\u2022 Toplu D\u00FCzenleme: \u00C7oklu sat\u0131r se\u00E7erek \u0027Toplu D\u00FCzenle\u0027 butonuyla bak\u0131m tarihi, firma, ar\u0131za veya sonu\u00E7 bilgisini tek seferde g\u00FCncelleyin.\n\u2022 Raporlama \u0026 Yazd\u0131rma: Servis kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 filtrelere g\u00F6re listeleyip yazd\u0131r\u0131labilir servis formu \u00E7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131 al\u0131n veya Excel\u0027e aktar\u0131n.",
  "guide_user_backup_title": "Otomatik Yedekleme, Veritaban\u0131 Sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131 \u0026 Bak\u0131m",
  "guide_user_backup_desc": "Veri g\u00FCvenli\u011Fi ve s\u0131f\u0131r kay\u0131p garantisi i\u00E7in yerle\u015Fik koruma mekanizmalar\u0131:\n\u2022 G\u00FCnl\u00FCk Otomatik Yedekleme: Program her g\u00FCn ilk a\u00E7\u0131l\u0131\u015Fta veritaban\u0131n\u0131n (.db) yede\u011Fini sessizce al\u0131r.\n\u2022 Tam Excel \u0026 ZIP Ar\u015Fivi: Tek t\u0131kla t\u00FCm tablolar\u0131 Excel dosyalar\u0131na d\u00F6k\u00FCp s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F ZIP paketi olarak ar\u015Fivler.\n\u2022 Sa\u011Fl\u0131k Kontrol\u00FC \u0026 VACUUM: Ayarlar men\u00FCs\u00FCnden \u0027B\u00FCt\u00FCnl\u00FCk Kontrol\u00FC\u0027 (PRAGMA quick_check) ve \u0027Veritaban\u0131 Optimize Et\u0027 (VACUUM) \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rarak dosya boyutunu k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCltebilir ve performans\u0131 zirvede tutabilirsiniz.",
  "guide_user_reports_title": "Dashboard Grafikleri, Raporlama \u0026 Yazd\u0131rma \u00C7\u0131kt\u0131lar\u0131",
  "guide_user_reports_desc": "Envanter hareketlerini analitik i\u00E7g\u00F6r\u00FClere d\u00F6n\u00FC\u015Ft\u00FCr\u00FCn:\n\u2022 ScottPlot Destekli Grafikler: En \u00E7ok t\u00FCketilen \u00FCr\u00FCnleri, departman da\u011F\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 ve kritik stok seviyelerini dinamik grafiklerle izleyin.\n\u2022 Filtreli T\u00FCketim Raporu: Belirli tarih, \u00FCr\u00FCn veya departman aral\u0131\u011F\u0131nda t\u00FCketim raporu \u00FCretin.\n\u2022 Sayfalamas\u0131z Tam Veri Aktar\u0131m\u0131: Sayfada ka\u00E7 kay\u0131t g\u00F6r\u00FCn\u00FCrse g\u00F6r\u00FCns\u00FCn, d\u0131\u015Fa aktar ve yazd\u0131r komutlar\u0131 filtrenize uyan t\u00FCm kay\u0131tlar\u0131 eksiksiz al\u0131r.\n\u2022 Taray\u0131c\u0131da Yazd\u0131rma: Raporlar\u0131 \u015F\u0131k HTML/CSS format\u0131nda do\u011Frudan yaz\u0131c\u0131ya veya PDF\u0027e aktar\u0131n.",
  "guide_dev_perf_title": "SQLite Performans, H\u0131z \u0026 Optimizasyon Altyap\u0131s\u0131",
  "guide_dev_perf_desc": "Veritaban\u0131n\u0131n binlerce kay\u0131tta bile milisaniyeler i\u00E7inde yan\u0131t vermesi i\u00E7in \u015Fu ileri seviye optimizasyonlar yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r:\n\u2022 Memory-Mapped I/O (mmap_size = 256MB): Dosya okuma i\u015Flemlerini i\u015Fletim sistemi seviyesinde do\u011Frudan RAM\u0027e e\u015Fleyerek disk gecikmelerini s\u0131f\u0131rlar. SSD veya HDD fark etmeksizin a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131 okuma sa\u011Flar.\n\u2022 Geni\u015F Bellek \u00D6nbelle\u011Fi (cache_size = 128MB): S\u0131k kullan\u0131lan veri sayfalar\u0131n\u0131 ve sorgu sonu\u00E7lar\u0131n\u0131 bellekte tutarak disk okumas\u0131n\u0131 en aza indirir.\n\u2022 WAL Modu (Write-Ahead Logging): Yazma i\u015Flemlerinin okumalar\u0131 engellemesini engelleyerek y\u00FCksek e\u015Fzamanl\u0131 \u00E7al\u0131\u015Fma performans\u0131 sunar.\n\u2022 journal_size_limit (64MB) \u0026 Incremental Auto-Vacuum: WAL log dosyalar\u0131n\u0131n diskte gereksiz yer kaplamas\u0131n\u0131 ve \u015Fi\u015Fmesini \u00F6nler.",
  "guide_dev_mvvm_title": "Gev\u015Fek Ba\u011Fl\u0131 MVVM Mimari Tasar\u0131m Deseni",
  "guide_dev_mvvm_desc": "Stokendra, modern ve gev\u015Fek ba\u011Fl\u0131 (loosely coupled) bir MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel) standart\u0131na sahiptir:\n\u2022 G\u00F6r\u00FCn\u00FCm Modelleri (ViewModels): CommunityToolkit.Mvvm k\u00FCt\u00FCphanesini temel al\u0131r. \u0060[ObservableProperty]\u0060 ve \u0060[RelayCommand]\u0060 nitelikleri (Attributes) kullan\u0131larak kod yaz\u0131m hamall\u0131\u011F\u0131 (boilerplate) ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F, gerekli bind kodlar\u0131 Source Generator\u0027lar arac\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131yla derleme zaman\u0131nda otomatik \u00FCretilir.\n\u2022 Ba\u011F\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k Enjeksiyonu (DI): Program.cs i\u00E7erisinde kurulan Microsoft DI Container sayesinde \u0060IStockCardRepository\u0060, \u0060IMovementRepository\u0060, \u0060IDialogService\u0060 gibi aray\u00FCzler ve t\u00FCm ViewModel s\u0131n\u0131flar\u0131 Container \u00FCzerinden y\u00F6netilir ve constructor injection ile talep edilir.",
  "guide_dev_folders_title": "Proje Klas\u00F6r Hiyerar\u015Fisi ve Dosya Yap\u0131s\u0131",
  "guide_dev_folders_desc": "\u2022 Views: Avalonia UI tabanl\u0131 XAML tasar\u0131mlar\u0131 (.axaml) ve bunlara ait g\u00F6r\u00FCn\u00FCm arkas\u0131 kodlar\u0131 (code-behind).\n\u2022 ViewModels: \u0130\u015F mant\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n, veri ba\u011Flama (Data Binding) \u00F6zelliklerinin ve UI komutlar\u0131n\u0131n (ICommand) bulundu\u011Fu s\u0131n\u0131flar.\n\u2022 Models: Veritaban\u0131 tablolar\u0131yla birebir e\u015Fle\u015Fen ve de\u011Fi\u015Fiklik bildirimi (INotifyPropertyChanged) sunan veri modelleri.\n\u2022 Data: SQLite ba\u011Flant\u0131 y\u00F6netiminin yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 yer. \u0060Database.cs\u0060 ba\u011Flant\u0131 havuzunu, \u0060Database.Migrations.cs\u0060 \u015Fema migrasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 ve repository s\u0131n\u0131flar\u0131 veritaban\u0131 i\u015Flemlerini bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131r.\n\u2022 Services: ClosedXML destekli Excel okuma/yazma servisleri ve ZipArchive destekli yedekleme servisleri.\n\u2022 Infrastructure: Dil \u00E7eviri sistemi (LocalizationManager), AppInfo ve XAML markup extension\u0027lar\u0131n\u0131 i\u00E7erir.",
  "guide_dev_lang_title": "Dinamik \u00C7oklu Dil \u0026 \u00C7eviri Mekanizmas\u0131",
  "guide_dev_lang_desc": "Uygulaman\u0131n dil altyap\u0131s\u0131 dinamik JSON kaynaklar\u0131na dayan\u0131r:\n\u2022 \u00C7eviri Kaynaklar\u0131: \u0027Resources/lang_tr.json\u0027 ve \u0027lang_en.json\u0027 dosyalar\u0131nda 570\u002B\u0027i a\u015Fk\u0131n anahtar birebir simetrik olarak tutulur.\n\u2022 XAML Entegrasyonu: \u0027{infra:L key_adi}\u0027 markup uzant\u0131s\u0131 ile XAML i\u00E7erisinde do\u011Frudan \u00E7eviriler ba\u011Flan\u0131r.\n\u2022 Dil De\u011Fi\u015Fimi: Ayarlardan dil se\u00E7imi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirildi\u011Finde ayarlar kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak kaydedilir ve temiz bir oturum i\u00E7in uygulama otomatik yeniden ba\u015Flat\u0131l\u0131r.",
  "guide_dev_db_title": "Dapper ORM \u0026 Veritaban\u0131 Migrasyon Motoru",
  "guide_dev_db_desc": "Entity Framework gibi a\u011F\u0131r ORM ara\u00E7lar\u0131n\u0131n getirdi\u011Fi performans kay\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131 engellemek i\u00E7in hafif ve a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131 olan Dapper ORM kullan\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r:\n\u2022 Veritaban\u0131 Migrasyonlar\u0131: \u015Eema de\u011Fi\u015Fti\u011Finde \u0060Database.cs\u0060 i\u00E7indeki \u0060CurrentSchemaVersion\u0060 art\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Migrasyon motoru SQLite \u00FCzerindeki \u0060user_version\u0060 de\u011Ferini kontrol eder ve s\u0131rayla \u0060MigrateToV14\u0060, \u0060MigrateToV15\u0060 gibi metotlar\u0131 kay\u0131ps\u0131z \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rarak tablolar\u0131 ve kolonlar\u0131 otomatik g\u00FCnceller.",
  "guide_dev_roadmap_title": "Geli\u015Ftirici Yol Haritas\u0131 \u0026 v7.4.0 Ba\u015Far\u0131lar\u0131",
  "guide_dev_roadmap_desc": "\u2022 v7.4.0 Ba\u015Far\u0131lar\u0131: Merkezi AppInfo s\u00FCr\u00FCm mimarisi, Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Rolleri \u0026 G\u00FCvenlik (PBKDF2 600K), Aktivite Denetim G\u00FCnl\u00FC\u011F\u00FC (AuditLog), Notlar Mod\u00FCl\u00FC, Toplu D\u00FCzenleme pencereleri, Sayfalamadan ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z Excel/Yazd\u0131rma, In-App Updater ve %100 Senkronize \u00C7ift Dilli UI.\n\u2022 Gelecek Yol Haritas\u0131:\n1. Barkod \u0026 QR Kod Deste\u011Fi: USB barkod okuyucu ve kamera ile an\u0131nda stok kart\u0131/hareket bulma.\n2. Bulut \u0026 \u00C7oklu Cihaz Senkronizasyonu: PostgreSQL veya Firebase adapt\u00F6r\u00FC ile ortak a\u011Fda canl\u0131 veri payla\u015F\u0131m\u0131.\n3. Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Bildirimler: Kritik stok limitinde otomatik e-posta bildirimleri.",
