  "title_required": "Ba\u015Fl\u0131k zorunludur.",
  "db_fk_violation": "\u0027{0}\u0027 tablosunda sat\u0131r {1}, \u0027{2}\u0027 tablosuna referans veren yabanc\u0131 anahtar k\u0131s\u0131tlamas\u0131n\u0131 ihlal ediyor.",
  "guide_user_notes_title": "H\u0131zl\u0131 Notlar \u0026 Operasyonel G\u00F6rev Takibi",
  "guide_user_notes_desc": "G\u00FCnl\u00FCk depo i\u015Fleyi\u015Fi, tedarik\u00E7i notlar\u0131 ve operasyonel hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131lar i\u00E7in dahili not defteri:\n\u2022 Not Ekleme \u0026 D\u00FCzenleme: Ba\u015Fl\u0131k ve a\u00E7\u0131klama metniyle notlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 saklay\u0131n.\n\u2022 Arama \u0026 Filtreleme: Ar\u015Fivinizdeki y\u00FCzlerce not aras\u0131nda an\u0131nda canl\u0131 arama yap\u0131n.\n\u2022 Toplu \u0130\u015Flemler: Birden fazla notu se\u00E7erek toplu ba\u015Fl\u0131k \u00F6neki veya i\u00E7erik ekleme ile organize edin.",
  "guide_user_users_title": "Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Y\u00F6netimi, Roller \u0026 G\u00FCvenlik Politikas\u0131",
  "guide_user_users_desc": "\u00C7oklu kullan\u0131c\u0131 ve rol bazl\u0131 eri\u015Fim denetimi altyap\u0131s\u0131:\n\u2022 Y\u00F6netici (Admin) vs Kullan\u0131c\u0131 (User): Y\u00F6neticiler t\u00FCm ayarlar\u0131, kullan\u0131c\u0131 hesaplar\u0131n\u0131 ve veritaban\u0131 i\u015Flemlerini y\u00F6netebilir; Kullan\u0131c\u0131 rol\u00FC operasyonel veri giri\u015Fine odaklan\u0131r.\n\u2022 G\u00FCvenli \u015Eifreleme: Parolalar v4 PBKDF2 (600.000 iterasyon) ile hash\u0027lenir; kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 i\u00E7eren veya 4 karakterden k\u0131sa zay\u0131f \u015Fifrelere izin verilmez.\n\u2022 Acil Durum Kurtarma: \u015Eifre unutuldu\u011Funda Ayarlar\u0027da tan\u0131mlanan \u0027Master G\u00FCvenlik Kodu\u0027 ile an\u0131nda \u015Fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanabilir.",
  "guide_user_updates_title": "Canl\u0131 G\u00FCncelleme \u0026 Yenilik Takibi (In-App Live Updater)",
  "guide_user_updates_desc": "Stokendra her zaman g\u00FCncel ve g\u00FCvende kal\u0131r:\n\u2022 Otomatik S\u00FCr\u00FCm Denetimi: Program a\u00E7\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda GitHub Releases \u00FCzerinden yeni bir s\u00FCr\u00FCm olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 sessizce kontrol eder.\n\u2022 Tek T\u0131kla G\u00FCncelleme Banner\u0027\u0131: Yeni s\u00FCr\u00FCm \u00E7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \u00FCst k\u0131s\u0131mda bilgilendirme band\u0131 g\u00F6r\u00FCn\u00FCr; \u0027\u0130ndir ve Kur\u0027 butonu ile arka planda kurulum dosyas\u0131n\u0131 indirir ve otomatik olarak ba\u015Flat\u0131r.\n\u2022 S\u00FCr\u00FCm Notlar\u0131: Her g\u00FCncellemenin getirdi\u011Fi yenilikleri do\u011Frudan uygulama i\u00E7inden inceleyebilirsiniz.",
  "guide_dev_excel_title": "ExcelImportHelper \u0026 K\u00FClt\u00FCr Uyumlu Veri \u0130\u015Fleme",
  "guide_dev_excel_desc": "ClosedXML k\u00FCt\u00FCphanesi \u00FCzerine in\u015Fa edilen ExcelImportHelper ile veri aktar\u0131m\u0131 z\u0131rhland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r:\n\u2022 Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Tarih Ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rma: Excel OLE seri tarih numaralar\u0131n\u0131 (45678.5 gibi), ISO ve T\u00FCrk\u00E7e tarih metinlerini otomatik tan\u0131r.\n\u2022 K\u00FClt\u00FCrden Ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z Ondal\u0131klar: \u002715,5\u0027 ve \u002715.5\u0027 gibi virg\u00FCl/nokta farkl\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 invariant float standard\u0131yla s\u0131f\u0131r kay\u0131pla parse eder.\n\u2022 Dinamik E\u015Fle\u015Ftirme (Synonyms): T\u00FCrk\u00E7e ve \u0130ngilizce kolon ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 (\u00F6rne\u011Fin \u0027bak\u0131m tarihi\u0027 / \u0027service date\u0027) otomatik e\u015Fleyerek esnek i\u00E7e aktar\u0131m sa\u011Flar."
}